# The whole repository is every bot's build context (each Dockerfile copies
# shared/ and its own folder). This keeps the rest out -- above all every
# .env and testbot/token.env, which hold real tokens.
.env
**/.env
testbot/token.env
testbot/.persona
testbot/.lock
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/logs
backups
tests
docs
Design
